<aura:documentation>
	<aura:description>

    <p>Link Component</p>

    <!-- LAST UPDATED DATE / VERSION -->
    <p>Last Updated: 5/15/2019</p>
    <p>CurrentVersion: 1.1</p>
    <hr/>
    <!-- UPDATE DATE / VERSION WITH ANY UPDATES -->

    <p>Uses native Salesforce utilities to build a link to a community page.</p>
<pre>&lt;c:ISGLink label="Product Catalog" page="l1-offerings" /&gt;</pre>
    <br/>
    <p>This is also built specifically for the L2 Search... v.searchParams should match the search format:</p>
    <p>Params Object Structure:</p>
    <p>(This is then parsed in <code>ISGSearchParams</code> on the L2 Page)</p>
<pre>
   cat:      category
   q:        search term
   page:     current page
   type:     search type ('all', 'product', 'partner')
   dir:      sort direction ('asc' / 'desc')
   field:    sort field
   filters:  filters object</pre>

  <br/>
  <p>Example:</p>

<pre>&lt;c:ISGLink label="Search All Products" page="l2" searchParams="{!v.params}"/&gt;

  controller...

  component.set('v.params', {
    type: 'product'
  });</pre>

    <p>Resulting url:</p>

    <pre>https://nppdevpmp-intelcloudcrm.cs67.force.com/styleguide/s/l2?search=%7B%22type%22%3A%22product%22%7D</pre>

    <!-- CHANGELOG ADD ANY UPDATES HERE -->
    <hr/>
    <p>Change Log</p>


    <!-- CHANGELOG -->

  </aura:description>
</aura:documentation>